  <diagram name="Pagina-1" id="gtRiwwUeaK1abQWxis51">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2216" dy="2316" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml deployment\n\nleft to right direction\n\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam roundCorner 12\nskinparam componentStyle uml2\nskinparam linetype polyline\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\n\nskinparam node {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #444444\n    FontColor black\n}\n\nskinparam database {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #444444\n    FontColor black\n}\n\nskinparam component {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #444444\n    FontColor black\n}\n\nskinparam artifact {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #444444\n    FontColor black\n}\n\nskinparam cloud {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #444444\n    FontColor black\n}\n\nskinparam note {\n    BackgroundColor #F7F7F7\n    BorderColor #444444\n    FontColor black\n}\n\n&#39; The diagram shows the target deployment topology.\n&#39; The prototype currently runs one application-server instance.\n\nnode \&quot;Passenger Device\&quot; &lt;&lt;device&gt;&gt; as PassengerDevice {\n    artifact \&quot;Passenger Client\&quot; as PassengerClient\n}\n\nnode \&quot;Fleet Operator Device\&quot; &lt;&lt;device&gt;&gt; as OperatorDevice {\n    artifact \&quot;Fleet Operator Client\&quot; as OperatorClient\n}\n\ncloud \&quot;Internet / Network\&quot; as Network\n\nnode \&quot;Application Server\\n(target: replicable; prototype: single instance)\&quot; &lt;&lt;server&gt;&gt; as AppServer {\n    component \&quot;API Gateway\&quot; as APIGateway\n    component \&quot;Authentication Manager\&quot; as AuthManager\n    component \&quot;Ride Request Manager\&quot; as RideRequestManager\n    component \&quot;Allocation Manager\&quot; as AllocationManager\n    component \&quot;Notification Manager\&quot; as NotificationManager\n    component \&quot;Maintenance Manager\&quot; as MaintenanceManager\n    component \&quot;Rebalancing Manager\&quot; as RebalancingManager\n    component \&quot;Fleet Monitor\&quot; as FleetMonitor\n    component \&quot;Mode Controller\&quot; as ModeController\n    component \&quot;Persistence Manager\&quot; as PersistenceManager\n    component \&quot;External Services Gateway\&quot; as ExternalServicesGateway\n}\n\ndatabase \&quot;Database Node\&quot; as DB {\n    artifact \&quot;ROAd Database\\naccounts, rides, reservations,\\nfleet, demand and alerts\&quot; as RoadDB\n}\n\nnode \&quot;Robotaxi\&quot; &lt;&lt;device&gt;&gt; as Robotaxi {\n    component \&quot;On-board Control API\&quot; as RobotaxiAPI\n}\n\ncloud \&quot;External Providers\\nRouting / Traffic\&quot; as ExternalSystems\n\n&#39; Client and network deployment\nPassengerClient --&gt; Network : HTTPS / WebSocket\nOperatorClient --&gt; Network : HTTPS / WebSocket\nNetwork --&gt; APIGateway : REST API requests\n\n&#39; Internal component dependencies are intentionally omitted here; they are\n&#39; documented in the component view (Figure 2.1).\nPersistenceManager --&gt; RoadDB : reads and writes\n\n&#39; External communication\nExternalServicesGateway --&gt; Network : external API calls\nNetwork &lt;--&gt; RobotaxiAPI : commands / telemetry\nNetwork &lt;--&gt; ExternalSystems : routing / traffic\nPassengerClient --&gt; Network : geocoding / road snapping\n\nnote right of AppServer\n    The server tier is architecturally replicable,\n    but the prototype keeps the fleet simulator and\n    WebSocket session registries in process-local memory.\n    Periodic jobs are enabled on one instance only.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of DB\n    Demand samples and active demand events are\n    persisted here; demand is not obtained from\n    an external demand provider in the prototype.\nend note\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="cJu0xcKQVI06VVuAYwBY-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
